enemies<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715470/extras/5f8d0642589be27b9120889abfe9c181.poster.avif?t=1646252759\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715470/extras/5f8d0642589be27b9120889abfe9c181.webm?t=1646252759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715470/extras/5f8d0642589be27b9120889abfe9c181.mp4?t=1646252759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A level map purchase system that helps you solve puzzles<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715470/extras/927894dc79fb48f2356cabb7663e51f2.poster.avif?t=1646252759\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715470/extras/927894dc79fb48f2356cabb7663e51f2.webm?t=1646252759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715470/extras/927894dc79fb48f2356cabb7663e51f2.mp4?t=1646252759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>And a world full of unique challenges, environments and characters<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715470/extras/7c5251ae6ff16fec72dbe66173d36cb5.poster.avif?t=1646252759\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715470/extras/7c5251ae6ff16fec72dbe66173d36cb5.webm?t=1646252759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715470/extras/7c5251ae6ff16fec72dbe66173d36cb5.mp4?t=1646252759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game contains</h2><ul class=\"